# NOTE: the sensitivity knowledge base is NOT here. It is hand-curated
# source, not a derived artifact, and it lives with the code that needs it
# in backend/app/ml/knowledge/. It used to be written into data/processed/,
# which meant a fresh clone had no knowledge base at all and silently
# cleared every allergen. Keep it out of ignored directories.

